    <sys:String x:Key="AllTraffic_Help" xml:space="preserve">Everything that belongs to no other tile goes through this tile’s VPN. With no other tiles, that is all traffic. It comes after every tile. Any tile’s sites and templates outrank programs: YouTube from its own tile goes by that tile in Chrome too. If one address is in two tiles, the one further left wins.&#10;&#10;The kill-switch works always: on and this tile’s VPN down (or the tile off) — this traffic has no internet.&#10;&#10;“Block” on the plate: while the tile is on, everything outside the other tiles is blocked.</sys:String>
