    <sys:String x:Key="Log_HintProblems">What the launcher is involved in: its rules, the kill-switch, failed VPN nodes and DNS.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Log_HintAds">What DNS filtered out — your router, your ISP, your own NextDNS/AdGuard or your DNS from the «DNS» window: ads, counters, trackers. Normal, not a fault; the row says which one.</sys:String>
